WEBVTT

00:09:28.814 --> 00:09:31.775
The black dotted line is the moment
of pressing down the foot,

00:09:31.817 --> 00:09:35.571
and you can see the brain signal
is different before to after,

00:09:35.613 --> 00:09:39.033
which means we can turn
that into a switch.

00:09:40.117 --> 00:09:42.995
Now we repeat this for several
different types of movements,

00:09:42.995 --> 00:09:45.873
say, open/close your hand
or pincer-grip your finger.

00:09:45.914 --> 00:09:48.250
Now, that may not seem like much,

00:09:48.292 --> 00:09:51.920
but these become the building blocks
for every single interaction

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.090
on a digital device
that is needed for control.

00:09:57.801 --> 00:09:59.720
Converted to

00:09:59.762 --> 00:10:03.807
click, up, down, left, right,
menu, back, etc.